r","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-09T15:15:53-08:00","id":1295403,"title":"","content":"I started spreading the word over at SpaceBattles forums, to try and draw in some last-minute buyers.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure if I should try at SufficientVelocity forums. I know Revlid and EarthScorpion hang out there, and last I checked they were bitterly hateful of Third Edition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-09T16:09:22-08:00","id":1295409,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1294844-thousand-blades-style-potential-sources-of-inspiration?p=1295182#post1295182\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Did you mean Vergil? I know Vergil summons glowing spiritual swords to circle around him protectively, but I don't recall Dante having more than the one sword. I've never played the games, but I've watch a showcase of his various weapons, and the closest that comes is a spike-shooting set of &quot;wings&quot; that are more like mantis arms.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe they mean the fact that he seems to just completely and instantly master any weapon the second he lays hands on it no matter how weird it is (like tri-chucks or a guitar that summons electric bats)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-09T19:28:17-08:00","id":1295442,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1294844-thousand-blades-style-potential-sources-of-inspiration?p=1295403#post1295403\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I started spreading the word over at SpaceBattles forums, to try and draw in some last-minute buyers.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure if I should try at SufficientVelocity forums. I know Revlid and EarthScorpion hang out there, and last I checked they were bitterly hateful of Third Edition.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean.....Lunars being awesome is something plenty of people have wanted since the game started, so maybe they'd like the opportunty to check them out?<br /> <br /> ....Or maybe they'll just rehash why 3e is terrible and turn off more people. I don't really know.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-09T19:40:52-08:00","id":1295446,"title":"","content":"Thousand Blades Style has been mentioned to be an esoteric martial art. It involves flying swords, I wonder if it is a style that can only be practiced by exalted and spirits unlike other styles that have mortal adherents? Perhaps it is the last remnants of a trend in the first age of essence fueled martial arts that just couldn\u2019t survive in the ruins of the current one.<br /> <br /> I am very interested in seeing how it will work out mechanically! I have always liked the visual style as portrayed in the videos people already posted/mentioned. I had always attributed the sword wings to being a special artifact but a martial arts route is intriguing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2302-snakesandsuns","name":"Snakesandsuns","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2302_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"224"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-09T21:00:49-08:00","id":1295471,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1294844-thousand-blades-style-potential-sources-of-inspiration?p=1295442#post1295442\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I mean.....Lunars being awesome is something plenty of people have wanted since the game started, so maybe they'd like the opportunty to check them out?<br /> <br /> ....Or maybe they'll just rehash why 3e is terrible and turn off more people. I don't really know.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why only do one when they could check out FatG <i>and</i> decide for inane reasons that it\u2019s terrible too? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-09T21:14:43-08:00","id":1295481,"title":"","content":"Sufficient Velocity was already talking about the kickstarter, so I threw my endorsement in and left it at that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-09T21:43:55-08:00","id":1295491,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Snakesandsuns</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1294844-thousand-blades-style-potential-sources-of-inspiration?p=1295446#post1295446\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thousand Blades Style has been mentioned to be an esoteric martial art. It involves flying swords, I wonder if it is a style that can only be practiced by exalted and spirits unlike other styles that have mortal adherents? Perhaps it is the last remnants of a trend in the first age of essence fueled martial arts that just couldn\u2019t survive in the ruins of the current one.<br /> <br /> I am very interested in seeing how it will work out mechanically! I have always liked the visual style as portrayed in the videos people already posted/mentioned. I had always attributed the sword wings to being a special artifact but a martial arts route is intriguing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh, mortal adherents of Snake Style can't skewer through armor with essence fortified fingertips but they are still users of the style. I'm sure it will have something mortals can do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-09T22:36:39-08:00","id":1295499,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stephen Lea Sheppard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1294844-thousand-blades-style-potential-sources-of-inspiration?p=1295081#post1295081\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(I'll be peeved if we don't hit that stretch goal.)</div> </div> </div> </div>You will not be the only one! I've been looking forward to seeing Thousand Blade Style since it was first mentioned. Not getting it will probably turn me off of the kickstarters going forward.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2103-talosx","name":"TalosX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"588"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-10T08:43:28-07:00","id":1295569,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TalosX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1294844-thousand-blades-style-potential-sources-of-inspiration?p=1295499#post1295499\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You will not be the only one! I've been looking forward to seeing Thousand Blade Style since it was first mentioned. Not getting it will probably turn me off of the kickstarters going forward.</div> </div> </div> </div>Bad enough we missed out on the additional Warstriders in <i>Heirs of the Shogunate</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-10T09:08:29-07:00","id":1295571,"title":"","content":"I'm sure we'll get it in another book in the future rather than sooner, but saying it's going to turn you off from the future Kickstarters is a little sad. Exchange rates, increase of shipping costs, and other realities of life makes it very expensive for a lot of people and they've put in what they could.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThe very existence of flame-throwers proves that some time, somewhere, someone said to themselves, You know, I want to set those people over there on fire, but I'm just not close enough to get the job done.\u201d George Carlin","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/123-trax","name":"Trax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar123_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"176"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-10T09:08:41-07:00","id":1295572,"title":"","content":"If you want it to happen, tell your friends about the kickstarter! Try to spread the word.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Violet Green, Freelancer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23657-violetdreamer","name":"VioletDreamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23657_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-10T11:08:17-07:00","id":1295590,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1294844-thousand-blades-style-potential-sources-of-inspiration?p=1295569#post1295569\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Bad enough we missed out on the additional Warstriders in <i>Heirs of the Shogunate</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh damn, I thought we'd hit that one! Now I'm sad again.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-10T13:22:28-07:00","id":1295624,"title":"","content":"We have now paid enough for the privilege to buy more. I put down another $10 to get Creatures of the Wyld and other old books.<br /> <br /> We are $19,000 away from Sublime Danger and Thousand Blade Style. <br /> <br /> There are a lot of special \u201cdesign this thing for me\u201d slots left to buy that would really help us towards reaching that goal, but anyone willing to buy those has probably already done so.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-10T14:48:56-07:00","id":1295656,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stephen Lea Sheppard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1294844-thousand-blades-style-potential-sources-of-inspiration?p=1295081#post1295081\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(I'll be peeved if we don't hit that stretch goal.)</div> </div> </div> </div>This times a thousand; Thousand Blades Style is utterly <i>perfect</i> for one of the PCs in my ongoing chronicle. Here's to the last-couple-days-of-the-KS surge!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7058-kerredai","name":"Kerredai","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-10T15:23:17-07:00","id":1295668,"title":"","content":"3 days and $18,000 to go.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-10T15:57:16-07:00","id":1295674,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1294844-thousand-blades-style-potential-sources-of-inspiration?p=1295182#post1295182\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Did you mean Vergil? I know Vergil summons glowing spiritual swords to circle around him protectively, but I don't recall Dante having more than the one sword. I've never played the games, but I've watch a showcase of his various weapons, and the closest that comes is a spike-shooting set of &quot;wings&quot; that are more like mantis arms.</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually (and fortuitously), Dante in DMC5 gets a weapon with summon sword powers, and it is <i>way</i> closer to how I always imagined Thousand Blades Style to be than Vergil's summon swords ever were.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/229-stephen-lea-sheppard","name":"Stephen Lea Sheppard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar229_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-10T16:34:11-07:00","id":1295684,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1294844-thousand-blades-style-potential-sources-of-inspiration?p=1295668#post1295668\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">3 days and $18,000 to go.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> We'll hit it. There's been more momentum today than each day of the last week or so, and we should keep picking up momentum through the end of the campaign at this point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13008,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13008-jade-wrought-sunfire","user":"Jade-Wrought Sunfire","date":". 03-10-2019, 07:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13008-jade-wrought-sunfire","name":"Jade-Wrought Sunfire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-10T16:37:25-07:00","id":1295685,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stephen Lea Sheppard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1294844-thousand-blades-style-potential-sources-of-inspiration?p=1295674#post1295674\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Actually (and fortuitously), Dante in DMC5 gets a weapon with summon sword powers, and it is <i>way</i> closer to how I always imagined Thousand Blades Style to be than Vergil's summon swords ever were.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Sadly I've yet to see a good video of someone going to town with devil sword Dante","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-10T17:21:15-07:00","id":1295692,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1294844-thousand-blades-style-potential-sources-of-inspiration?p=1295569#post1295569\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Bad enough we missed out on the additional Warstriders in <i>Heirs of the Shogunate</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a couple of things for me. Sublime Danger and Thousand Blade Style was mentioned to be a part of the Lunar's splat years ago, after the Visiting Flare comic was released. To not get them now after the long wait, plus the debacle with the 3E Core delay, and the Dragonblood book still not out a year after the kickstarter. I really like Vance and Minton's vision for Exalted so far, but there's a lot of disappointment continuing to pile up for me!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2103-talosx","name":"TalosX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"588"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-10T17:43:57-07:00","id":1295700,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TalosX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1294844-thousand-blades-style-potential-sources-of-inspiration?p=1295692#post1295692\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's a couple of things for me. Sublime Danger and Thousand Blade Style was mentioned to be a part of the Lunar's splat years ago, after the Visiting Flare comic was released. To not get them now after the long wait, plus the debacle with the 3E Core delay,<b> and the Dragonblood book still not out a year after the kickstarter.</b> I really like Vance and Minton's vision for Exalted so far, but there's a lot of disappointment continuing to pile up for me!</div> </div> </div> </div>1# Its definitely out for backers, I have the final product downloaded on my phone and computer. Not the text only preview but with the pictures and rewrites from proofreading and everything. We actually got it ahead of promised schedule since we got it in 12/2018 instead of 2/2019 like they initially estimated in the PDF only backer level.<br /> <br /> 2# If you are talking about physical copies its still well within the time frame we were told up front on when we would be getting them. They told us we would get the hardcover by 12/2019 and its only 3/2019.<br /> <br /> 3# You seem to be incorrectly remembering when that Kickstarter ended, it ended on 4/26/2018 so its not even been a year. Even if you go with the start date instead its still not been a year. We got our finished PDF around 7 1/2 months after the kickstarter ended.<br /> <br /> However,<i> in fairness</i> they did give an estimated delivery of The Realm and Heirs to the Shogunate for 2/2019 and that didn't happen. So they were early with the main course and late with the side dishes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver 