 an estimated delivery of The Realm and Heirs to the Shogunate for 2/2019 and that didn't happen. So they were early with the main course and late with the side dishes.</div> </div> </div> </div>You can't claim it's finished if they were still making revisions/corrections. The final version has not been released, and was still layout as of a week or two ago according to the Monday updates. What you, and I because I'm a backer as well, have is a &quot;mostly done&quot; product. Vance was still making corrections and clarifications after it was released, so what you have is most definitely not the final product.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2103-talosx","name":"TalosX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"588"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-10T20:19:24-07:00","id":1295727,"title":"","content":"Hmm, really? Thats news to me actually. I thought what they were doing now was stuff involved in printing physical copies that had nothing to do with any possible content changes. Guess I was wrong on part of what I posted. Still, its definitely not been more then a year.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1